  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **July 2023 (Saturday)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Believe (Nobody Knows)**: back after 29 archived shows (632 days) [5]\n- **It's About Twilight Now**: back after 29 archived shows (632 days) [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2023-07-29.vwmule** (recommended): source not stated; 22 songs; 130 min [1]\n- **mmj2023-07-29.reagansdada**: source not stated; 21 songs; 133 min [2]\n- **mmj2023-07-29.mk41.flac24**: source not stated; 21 songs; 133 min [3]\n- **mmj2023-07-29.mk41.flac16**: source not stated; 21 songs; 133 min [4]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Katie Pruitt opened the show, marking the band's first performance at The Anthem [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2023-07-29.vwmule**: taped by Alex Leary; transferred by Alex Leary; source: Microtech Gefell M21 > nBob actives > Sound Devices MixPre-6 (24/48) [1]\n- **mmj2023-07-29.reagansdada**: taped by Dan Gottlieb; transferred by Dan Gottlieb; source: Audio Technica AT853 (Hyper Cardioid caps) > Zoom H6 (24/96) [2]\n- **mmj2023-07-29.mk41.flac24**: taped by Todd (titotito at gmail); transferred by Todd (titotito at gmail); source: mk41>kc5>cmc7>m248>mme>hdp2(24/96) [3]\n- **mmj2023-07-29.mk41.flac16**: taped by Todd (titotito at gmail); transferred by Todd (titotito at gmail); source: mk41>kc5>cmc6>m248>mme>hdp2 (24/96) [4]",
